                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1440993d-b4a3-49ef-9e1b-760369264db6",
                        "entry_id": "f9b1e420-bdf4-3ea6-afe8-43b59a987f6d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "improbables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f0778a89-2a3b-38e6-8aad-582e592feb1f",
                        "entry_id": "f9b1e420-bdf4-3ea6-afe8-43b59a987f6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui n’a pas de probabilité ; qui n’est pas probable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f99f5442-c13d-4de2-ad2d-240ad3d60944",
                                "sense_id": "f0778a89-2a3b-38e6-8aad-582e592feb1f",
                                "text": "Lorsqu'on veut se figurer la cosmogenèse, c'est une aventure étrange, assez récente, pareille en somme à ce que serait une explosion hiroshimesque aperçue au ralenti : à partir d'un moment improbable, une avalanche de nébuleuses ignées, qui fuient."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cebb7e46-d7bb-4b0f-a173-91e8d4e5d5c1",
                                "sense_id": "f0778a89-2a3b-38e6-8aad-582e592feb1f",
                                "text": "Un tel milieu est susceptible de protoner tout substrat organique et de favoriser des réactions improbables en chimie classique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7eefe38a-bc8e-41a3-a5f6-42d59317272b",
                                "sense_id": "f0778a89-2a3b-38e6-8aad-582e592feb1f",
                                "text": "Après 100 ans de recherche, aucun individu en mesure de démontrer […] des facultés extrasensorielles n’a été identifié. Pour cette seule raison, il est improbable que les facultés extra-sensorielles n’existent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7ffd65f-27d8-464f-927c-600e216541da",
                                "sense_id": "f0778a89-2a3b-38e6-8aad-582e592feb1f",
                                "text": "Le regard ankylosé par trop d’impérities, je cherchais un improbable mais tant espéré soutien au loin, partout et nulle part, peut-être vers le ciel où s'était machinalement orientée ma tête; ce ciel où avaient établi leurs pénates, mon défunt père et mes regrettées sœurs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "67913541-115b-34c3-9462-f26a63598a69",
                        "entry_id": "f9b1e420-bdf4-3ea6-afe8-43b59a987f6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Invraisemblable ; incroyable ; inattendu ; excentrique ; curieux ; insolite."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "note": "Il est souvent utilisé dans l'expression « endroit improbable »",
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d34eba1f-7299-4a21-9f4f-fbfc20382252",
                                "sense_id": "67913541-115b-34c3-9462-f26a63598a69",
                                "text": "L’improbable signature de Jack Lew : incompatible avec le dollar ? Note : Référence à la signature atypique et illisible de Jack Lew, chef de cabinet de la Maison-Blanche, pressenti pour occuper les fonctions de Secrétaire du Trésor des États-Unis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35546fe2-1082-4121-bb29-a3299dcc1de5",
                                "sense_id": "67913541-115b-34c3-9462-f26a63598a69",
                                "text": "Mais il se passa quelque chose auquel l'Anneau ne s'attendait pas : il fut ramassé par la créature la plus improbable qui soit, un Hobbit, Bilbon Sacquet, de la Comté."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e84fc24d-5a4d-4670-ba77-130c63c51c05",
                                "sense_id": "67913541-115b-34c3-9462-f26a63598a69",
                                "text": "L’improbable « accident » du MH370"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35c011fa-18b6-4916-a7c6-e23f9ebb3881",
                                "sense_id": "67913541-115b-34c3-9462-f26a63598a69",
                                "text": "Il arborait une improbable moustache en trait de crayon, et ça énervait Bilodeau autant que le reste."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8195dd73-fd3b-4998-aa12-51f9d025c09a",
                                "sense_id": "67913541-115b-34c3-9462-f26a63598a69",
                                "text": "Pendant quelques secondes, ils restèrent debout à m'examiner : Stefania, sorte d'apparition en salopette violette, et Leonie dans un énorme manteau de fourrure, un improbable gin tonic à la main."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "062311e6-f834-4e76-9b35-6bd8958912d4",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9b1e420-bdf4-3ea6-afe8-43b59a987f6d",
                        "target_lang_word": "unwahrscheinlich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unwahrscheinlich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b74018ac-039b-3652-89e1-d9fafb0bc8e0",
                                        "entry_id": "d612f12c-5f11-3365-a0a0-687952d2c4a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nicht wahrscheinlich; mit geringer Wahrscheinlichkeit"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e1c75c3-9615-41f8-8f26-4fb786678395",
                                                "sense_id": "b74018ac-039b-3652-89e1-d9fafb0bc8e0",
                                                "text": "Im Lotto zu gewinnen ist höchst unwahrscheinlich."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a57fdd52-8093-48e4-985d-a5f5829801b1",
                                                "sense_id": "b74018ac-039b-3652-89e1-d9fafb0bc8e0",
                                                "text": "„Denn selbst wenn es für die Wohnung bereits einen Nachmieter gibt, so ist es aktuell eher unwahrscheinlich, dass er oder sie demnächst einzieht.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "760e8f8d-0509-4124-9e26-a66aa416eaed",
                                                "sense_id": "b74018ac-039b-3652-89e1-d9fafb0bc8e0",
                                                "text": "„Die Regierungen der Welt haben sich im Paris-Abkommen verpflichtet, die Erderhitzung bei deutlich unter 2 Grad und möglichst bei 1,5 Grad zu begrenzen. Das erscheint aber zunehmend unwahrscheinlich.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0435beb-3207-3949-9fd9-ed0ed6eacd9b",
                                        "entry_id": "d612f12c-5f11-3365-a0a0-687952d2c4a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sehr, übermäßig"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "090ab5b6-c3ed-4447-829d-36924a19e596",
                                                "sense_id": "d0435beb-3207-3949-9fd9-ed0ed6eacd9b",
                                                "text": "Sie hatte bei der letzten Prüfung unwahrscheinliches Glück mit dem Thema gehabt."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9ca2832c-c431-4cba-90fd-8ece6a4860ba",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9b1e420-bdf4-3ea6-afe8-43b59a987f6d",
                        "target_lang_word": "unlikely",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unlikely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9fcea4b8-4c99-3e5d-841a-a555445ad608",
                                        "entry_id": "2c03325e-3fd7-3db8-bd75-8f3e5177a54b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not likely; improbable; not to be reasonably expected."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78e8067f-855b-45d2-96b0-ad17ed2d709b",
                                                "sense_id": "9fcea4b8-4c99-3e5d-841a-a555445ad608",
                                                "text": "It is pretty unlikely that you'll win, but I will pray that at least you do well."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb11ac65-e734-4507-a2f8-373420eeeada",
                                                "sense_id": "9fcea4b8-4c99-3e5d-841a-a555445ad608",
                                                "text": "In the highly unlikely event of landing in water, lifejackets are stored under the seat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8107dfe3-5523-4dcb-ae88-c3f75ae7e3e7",
                                                "sense_id": "9fcea4b8-4c99-3e5d-841a-a555445ad608",
                                                "text": "Now, I still think that for this box of matches to have escaped the wear of time for immemorial years was a strange, and for me, a most fortunate thing. Yet oddly enough I found here a far more unlikely substance, and that was camphor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6616befe-4776-4cef-8fc9-66b5968932d4",
                                                "sense_id": "9fcea4b8-4c99-3e5d-841a-a555445ad608",
                                                "text": "The Saturday evening Cardiff-West Wales mail train is still steam-worked, but a most unlikely locomotive used on May 23 was Stanier Class 5 4-6-0 No. 45250 (5A); it returned on May 25 with a train of steel billets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6da8a527-c2e4-4ada-ae5b-b4e649bdf5c5",
                                                "sense_id": "9fcea4b8-4c99-3e5d-841a-a555445ad608",
                                                "text": "Saturday’s tariffs are unlikely to be Trump’s last. The president said himself said in the Oval Office that additional tariffs could come by mid-February on chips, pharmaceuticals, steel, aluminum, copper, oil and gas imports – along with tariffs on the European Union – all threats that few would discount given his willingness to follow through on the North American and China tariffs on Saturday."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0b78879-85b4-40c5-95ff-2e29e2798222",
                                                "sense_id": "9fcea4b8-4c99-3e5d-841a-a555445ad608",
                                                "text": "Nor had the post mortem on Newson's body revealed any illness or other physical condition that might have prevented him from applying the brake, although after four days in the oven-like heat of the wreckage, the body was so badly decomposed as to make any reliable post mortem results unlikely."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16c9ec40-9f5f-3f90-9f36-5941c1ab7097",
                                        "entry_id": "2c03325e-3fd7-3db8-bd75-8f3e5177a54b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not holding out a prospect of success; likely to fail; unpromising."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac4e4227-d939-4fe5-969c-c1b3188ade95",
                                                "sense_id": "16c9ec40-9f5f-3f90-9f36-5941c1ab7097",
                                                "text": "unlikely means"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unlikely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "192fb67a-3bc8-3e2c-97ff-cb76876b6f4d",
                                        "entry_id": "a59c89ec-1936-3050-b746-711e005e23ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an improbable manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unlikely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1e94e57-1bac-30c2-ae8a-683edb062640",
                                        "entry_id": "6821dba0-d026-3eda-a953-fefe20fa7249",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something or somebody considered unlikely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68894c9c-2e1b-41ce-8ced-7d20cf539d84",
                                                "sense_id": "d1e94e57-1bac-30c2-ae8a-683edb062640",
                                                "text": "The molecular ion candidates are divided by the testing phase into three categories: rejects, unlikelies, and probables. Differences between each candidate and the prominent peaks in the spectrum are computed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e65e5f80-3c1f-4386-b5b2-f23fc90ed8f3",
                                                "sense_id": "d1e94e57-1bac-30c2-ae8a-683edb062640",
                                                "text": "\"Here is my every possible phone number, plus a few unlikelies. And I've also put down the numbers of Karin and Wade, in case you've lost them. Karin can come anytime; Wade, up until six in the morning.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5831239-bdee-45c5-b12e-8c686289d410",
                                                "sense_id": "d1e94e57-1bac-30c2-ae8a-683edb062640",
                                                "text": "Then the most unlikely of unlikelies happened. We got another phone call. Another woman wanted to give us a baby—a boy, born just that morning. We walked into a hospital, and he was placed into my arms."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
